%% Add an expense, with live updates and a budget alert. Claude rewrites this via /update-diagrams.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Family member
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as API (ExpenseService)
  participant D as SQLite
  participant H as SignalR hub
  participant O as Same family, other tabs

  U->>W: save the expense form
  W->>A: POST /api/v1/expenses with X-Family-Id
  Note over A: check permission expense.add, then pick the active family<br/>from the caller's own families (the header, else the earliest joined)<br/>and look up their role in it
  alt no family, or a Viewer
    A-->>W: 403 Forbidden
  else Owner or Member
    Note over A: validate contract and domain rules
    A->>D: insert the expense (GUID v7 id, family, creator, private flag)
    A->>D: sum this month's spending in the category (this family only)
    A->>H: expenses changed
    H-->>O: change notice to the family group, so cached queries refresh
    opt the category just went over budget
      A->>H: budget exceeded
      H-->>W: alert toast
      H-->>O: alert toast
    end
    A-->>W: 201 Created
  end
